+# Group Agent workspace embedding
+
+The surrounding team IM owns left navigation and conversation rendering. Its right pane embeds the existing Harness client plugin runtime, selecting `workspace-only=1` at launch. AppFrame mounts the native rightbar and overlays and measures the embedding box with its existing ResizeObserver. It does not crop or hide a mounted full application.
+
+The out-of-tree `@group-agent/dsh-bridge` selects Sessions through `uiWorkspace`; it does not recreate rightbar tabs, terminal ownership or file preview components. Authentication and workspace scope are enforced by the host bridge. The layout query parameter is not an authorization mechanism.
+
+Validation belongs to `app-frame.client.spec.tsx`, the Host and client aggregate checks, and the integration project's multi-browser replay against assembled artifacts. The normal layout remains the default.
